Package: titleclassifier
Title: Clean, Standardize, and Classify Nonprofit Executive Titles
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Jesse",
           family = "Lecy",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jdlecy@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4974-0782")),
    person(given = "Kevin",
           family = "Cui",
           role = "aut",
           email = "kc734@cornell.edu"))
Description: Tools to transform the raw, free-text officer and key-employee
    titles reported on IRS Form 990 Part VII into a structured, analysis-ready
    taxonomy. The pipeline standardizes the raw compensation table, removes
    dates, normalizes conjunctions and separators, splits multi-title strings,
    harmonizes spelling and abbreviations, flags status qualifiers, maps titles
    to canonical forms via a crosswalk, and assigns taxonomy categories with
    organization-level features, and resolves each person's role (chief
    executive, officer, manager, professional, staff, or board seat) from the
    filer's checkboxes, pay and hours, with a model for 990-EZ returns, which
    have no checkboxes. Includes helpers to fetch Part VII tables
    directly from the public NCCS efile store.
